  "title": "Is your organization truly ready?",
  "content": "Is your organization truly ready?\nAssess your operational readiness in eight questions. This initial, indicative review will help you structure the next steps.\nYour answers remain in this tab and are not sent to CORO.\nSelect an answer to continue.\nYour indicative result\nProvisional result — Insufficient information to assign a preparation level.\nReview of all eight dimensions\nNo strength can be derived from favourable answers.\nNo corrective priority emerges from the declared answers.\nThis diagnostic is indicative. It is based only on your answers, is not the official CORO Index and does not replace an audit or field validation.\nOne or more fundamental dimensions were declared not applicable; this conclusion should be validated.\nYour answers remained in this tab and were not sent to CORO.\nYour result is temporary and will not be retained after you close or refresh this page.\nIlluminated office building representing an organization ready to act.\nYour diagnostic is a first step. Resilience is built through action.\nTurn this initial review into concrete priorities, then validate them with your teams and in the field.\nCutaway building illustrating the interconnected dimensions of organizational resilience.\nThe report could not be generated. Try again.\nThe link could not be shared.\nYou know your priorities. Discover how to take action.\nWould you like to explore your diagnostic further or discover how CORO can support your organization? Talk with our team.\nTalk with the CORO team\nAssess your organization's emergency preparedness in eight questions. Discover your strengths and improvement priorities with CORO."
