  "title": "Discover the CORO partner ecosystem for building, safety and resilience professionals.",
  "content": "Discover the CORO partner ecosystem for building, safety and resilience professionals.\nAn ecosystem connecting expertise and operations.\nCORO works with professionals supporting organizations in fire safety, emergency management, continuity, property management and resilience.\nWho is this ecosystem for?\nConsultants and advisory firms\nFire safety and emergency management professionals\nProperty managers and risk specialists\nIntegrators and complementary solution providers\nA framework suited to each collaboration\nReferral, advisory, integration or resale relationships may be considered depending on context and require a written agreement.\nView the referral program"
